Package: dovecot-vpopmail
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 dovecot-core (>= 1:2.4),
 dovecot-imapd (>= 1:2.4),
 dovecot-pgsql (>= 1:2.4),
 vpopmail
Description: dovecot IMAP configuration for vpopmail/qmail
 Configuration package that integrates dovecot 2.4 with a vpopmail/qmail
 mail stack. Authenticates users against the vpopmail PostgreSQL database and
 serves mail from vpopmail Maildir directories.
 .
 Installs configuration snippets into /etc/dovecot/conf.d/ and sets up
 TLS using the certificate already generated by the qmail package.
